      "width": 375,
      "height": 237,
      "content": "Mobile mini tables use tighter horizontal padding to maximize content on small screens. Header rows ('Account Details', 'Balances', etc.) use spacing-xs (12px) all around. Detail rows use spacing-sm (16px) vertically, spacing-xs (12px) horizontally. Label columns are fixed at 110px to give values more room."
