      "width": 400,
      "height": 279,
      "content": "Desktop mini tables use standard spacing-sm (16px) padding on all sides for both header and detail rows. The gap between label and value columns is spacing-xl (24px).\n\nIn the modal's header, Institution logo is 36×36, header font is xl-semibold, and the drawer body uses spacing-xl (24px) padding."
